(text "04 | RTC, battery and microSD" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21906a44-e158-5002-94cb-2e3fea95fa01"))
(text "MCP7940N: I2C 0x6F; firmware must set ST and VBATEN and validate the time before schedules (as in EU-0.1).\nCR2032 is not rechargeable. No path from +3V3 to VBAT; MFP is unused.\nSD uses SPI; CMD and DAT0..DAT3 all have 10k pull-ups, including unused DAT1/2. SCK and MOSI series resistors are 100 R (stock) instead of 220 R.\nGCT MEM2061 drawing Rev A1: shell is ground; normally closed detect contact is unused. CD1/CD2 pads unused; both SH tabs grounded." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cd768b07-89f6-59d4-9e44-6b2ae924b887"))
